    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rendagor is a 2D Topdown Shooter starring a Rendagor Corporation service robot, just another robot... or maybe not?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the Rendagor C. secrets in story mode or try you hand at the arcade mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either way, shoot,beat 'n blast enemies (or the game enviroment) with a large set of weaponry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against the failed experiments of Rendagor Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/72e51928511cd2395aaba3d5a6dc9a50.poster.avif?t=1752434258\" width=454 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/72e51928511cd2395aaba3d5a6dc9a50.webm?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/72e51928511cd2395aaba3d5a6dc9a50.mp4?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocket fists, lasers, machine guns and much more! Use all the arsenal at your disposal to destroy Rendagor Corp's enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/4ceb1bc6d141efa7d153617ff7205b71.poster.avif?t=1752434258\" width=478 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/4ceb1bc6d141efa7d153617ff7205b71.webm?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/4ceb1bc6d141efa7d153617ff7205b71.mp4?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve small puzzles and explore the maps well for additional loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/e18498882257685aeec026c1951e28fa.poster.avif?t=1752434258\" width=454 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/e18498882257685aeec026c1951e28fa.webm?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/e18498882257685aeec026c1951e28fa.mp4?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend R-Coins to purchase what you need. An R-Shipping drone will make the delivery to your location.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/50714a4e807fc7e59fe67d8911a0bf1d.poster.avif?t=1752434258\" width=436 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/50714a4e807fc7e59fe67d8911a0bf1d.webm?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/50714a4e807fc7e59fe67d8911a0bf1d.mp4?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your robot using the R-Chips you recover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/3b3ebf36849652d032c328e1c1e760aa.poster.avif?t=1752434258\" width=452 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/3b3ebf36849652d032c328e1c1e760aa.webm?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/3b3ebf36849652d032c328e1c1e760aa.mp4?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill bosses at the end of each level to advance to the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/15570f5410fbe95bf878996ec4968428.poster.avif?t=1752434258\" width=344 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/15570f5410fbe95bf878996ec4968428.webm?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/15570f5410fbe95bf878996ec4968428.mp4?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face waves of random enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/2f41ffd938ed5a3a719a5057f81ea4e1.poster.avif?t=1752434258\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/2f41ffd938ed5a3a719a5057f81ea4e1.webm?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/2f41ffd938ed5a3a719a5057f81ea4e1.mp4?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each wave you will receive an R-Chip and can choose one among three random bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/97faa8266aad08e1f56c215467dbd390.poster.avif?t=1752434258\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/97faa8266aad08e1f56c215467dbd390.webm?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/97faa8266aad08e1f56c215467dbd390.mp4?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/62f5ac4adaeeb3a19e37735d17649082.poster.avif?t=1752434258\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/62f5ac4adaeeb3a19e37735d17649082.webm?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343710/extras/62f5ac4adaeeb3a19e37735d17649082.mp4?t=1752434258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
